<title>USA: Texas/w Oklahoma feedlot roundup - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Oklahoma feedlot roundup - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said trade was slow in the the Panhandle area late Friday. Slaughter steers and heifers closed steady.</p>
<p>Feedlots reported good inquiry from buyers. Sales reported on 3,700 slaughter steers and 900 slaughter heifers following the weekly movement of 104,500.</p>
<p>Steers - select and choice 2-3 1100-1250 lbs 68.00. Pen select, few choice 2-3 1200 lbs 67.25.</p>
<p>Heifers - select and choice 2-3 1000-1150 lbs 68.00.</p>
<p>Confirmed:    4,600     Week Ago:  800     Year Ago: 1,500</p>
</text>
